  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efficiency  Management Regional Investment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Eficiencia y Gestin Inversin Regional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT FOCUS IN IMPROVING THE PUBLIC REGIONAL INVESTMENT EFICIENCY ANF MANAGEMENT BY: (1) IMPROVING THE REGIONAL INVESTMENT COORDINATION AMONG SECTORS, AMONG FINANCING INSTRUMENTS, AND AMONG LEVELS OF ADMINISTRATION; (2) STRENGTHENING REGIONAL AND LOCAL INVESTMENT PLANNING; AND (3) IMPROVING THE DISTRIBUTION AND PRIORIZATION OF THE INVESTMENT WITHIN THE REGIONS AND THE IMPACT EVALUATION OF PROJECTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
